# Agentic Summary Safety

- Agentic/generated narrative copy (org insights, brand insights, readout
  summaries, priority sentences) must **never** take down a dashboard.
- If a signal field is missing (`lowestDept`, spread, delta, statement, etc.),
  omit that clause or fall back to a safe sentence. Do not dereference
  undefined objects.
- Prefer optional chaining and explicit null checks before interpolating
  agentic fields into strings.
- Isolate agentic generation per section/brand when practical so one bad
  summary cannot crash the whole page.
- Dashboards must still render tables/charts when narrative generation fails.
